`AppModals.jsx` is confirmed a pure mounting wrapper (no shell, no max-w). `RegulationsReference` is not mounted in AppModals — it's reached only through VAResources, which is why the inventory (event-driven scan) missed it. The `StressReliefDivision` overlay is mounted in `AppShellTop`. All `aria-modal` files are otherwise covered.

I have enough to compile the final report.

{"missed":[{"file":"src/components/RegulationsReference.jsx","name":"RegulationsReference","why":"Top-level modal: 'fixed inset-0 bg-black bg-opacity-50 z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-4' with role=dialog + aria-modal, inner 'max-w-5xl w-full max-h-[90vh] overflow-hidden flex flex-col', gradient header, onClose. Not event-driven (opened from VAResources.jsx via setShowRegulationsReference, line 689-691), so the inventory's openX-event scan missed it. size='xl'/'2xl'. Genuine standalone modal."},{"file":"src/components/TermsOfServicePage.jsx","name":"TermsOfServicePage","why":"DISTINCT from the inventoried TermsOfServiceModal.jsx. Full-screen page-scroll modal: 'fixed inset-0 z-50 overflow-y-auto bg-gray-900' + 'max-w-5xl mx-auto ... min-h-screen' with sticky red header. Opened via openTermsOfService window event through LegalPages.jsx (lazy-imported), rendered as {showTerms && <TermsOfServicePage/>}. The inventory only captured the small first-run TOS-acceptance gate (TermsOfServiceModal.jsx, modalClasses helper) and conflated/omitted this full-page variant. size='full'."},{"file":"src/components/VisionSimulator.jsx (src/features/vision/VisionSimulator.jsx)","name":"VisionSimulator","why":"Top-level modal mounted in AppModals.jsx (line 126). 'fixed inset-0 bg-black/60 flex items-center justify-center z-50 p-4' + 'max-w-2xl w-full max-h-[90vh] overflow-y-auto', floating corner close button (no role=dialog, no focus trap). Opens on openVisionSimulator window event (fired by LocalAIPanel line 2690). Wraps lazy VisionSimulatorPanel. Completely absent from inventory. size='lg'/'xl'."},{"file":"src/features/small-screen-warning/SmallScreenWarning.jsx","name":"SmallScreenWarning","why":"Top-level blocking modal mounted in AppShellOverlays.jsx (line 24). 'fixed inset-0 bg-black/80 backdrop-blur-sm z-[100] flex items-center justify-center p-4' + 'max-w-md' amber-bordered panel with Continue / Email CTAs. Shown when innerWidth<640, dismissal persisted in sessionStorage. No role=dialog, no focus trap. Absent from inventory. size='md'."},{"file":"src/components/StressReliefDivision.jsx","name":"StressReliefDivision (Doom easter egg)","why":"Top-level overlay mounted in AppShellTop.jsx (line 35). Main overlay 'fixed inset-0 z-[9999] bg-black/95 flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-4' with role=dialog + aria-label, plus a sibling 'fixed inset-0 z-[9998]' CRT-glitch decorative layer. ESC-to-close, [X] EXIT CTA. Absent from inventory. Very high z (9999) — like the safety overlays, would need elevated z if migrated. size='full'."},{"file":"src/components/FeatureLookup.jsx","name":"FeatureLookup (admin)","why":"Full-screen admin shell 'fixed inset-0 bg-slate-900/95 z-50 overflow-hidden flex flex-col' rendered inside AdminPanel.jsx (line 124) with onClose. Also contains a NESTED status-update modal at line 730 ('fixed inset-0 bg-black/70 ... z-50' + max-w-md). Admin-only, low priority, but a genuine overlay missing from inventory. size='full' + nested 'md'."},{"file":"src/components/BugLookup.jsx","name":"BugLookup (admin)","why":"Full-screen admin shell 'fixed inset-0 bg-slate-900/95 z-50 overflow-hidden flex flex-col' rendered inside AdminPanel.jsx (line 120) with onClose. Contains a NESTED resolve modal at line 751 ('fixed inset-0 bg-black/70 ... z-50' + max-w-md). Admin-only. Absent from inventory. size='full' + nested 'md'."},{"file":"src/components/DD214FormBuilder.jsx","name":"DD214FormBuilder","why":"createPortal modal: 'fixed inset-0 z-[9999] flex items-center justify-center p-4 bg-black/70 backdrop-blur-sm' + 'max-w-4xl max-h-[90vh] flex flex-col'. Rendered from DD214Analyzer.jsx (line 2359) — which IS in the inventory but marked nestedChildModals:false. This is a missed nested/child modal that stacks above DD214Analyzer at z-[9999]. size='xl'."},{"file":"src/components/PublicationsLibrary.jsx","name":"PublicationDetailsModal","why":"Nested child modal inside PublicationsLibrary.jsx (line 165): 'fixed inset-0 bg-black/50 flex items-center justify-center z-50 p-4' + 'max-w-2xl max-h-[90vh] overflow-y-auto'. The inventory captured the PublicationsLibraryModal wrapper but set nestedChildModals:false — this detail modal is a missed child. size='lg'."},{"file":"src/components/Pathfinder.jsx","name":"Pathfinder 'File Drop In' modal","why":"Pathfinder.jsx is the body rendered inside the inventoried PathfinderModal (PathfinderModal.jsx line 125), which the inventory marked nestedChildModals:false. It contains a nested 'File Drop In Modal' at line 1115 ('fixed inset-0 z-50 ... bg-black/50 backdrop-blur-sm' + 'max-w-lg max-h-[90vh]'). Missed nested child. size='lg'."}],"misclassifiedRisk":[{"file":"src/features/pathfinder/PathfinderModal.jsx","was":"nestedChildModals:false","shouldBe":"nestedChildModals:true","why":"Its body component Pathfinder.jsx renders a nested 'File Drop In' modal (line 1115) and also mounts VAGovRatingPaster (line 1105). Inventory's nestedChildModals:false is wrong."},{"file":"src/features/publications/PublicationsLibraryModal.jsx","was":"nestedChildModals:false","shouldBe":"nestedChildModals:true","why":"Body component PublicationsLibrary.jsx renders a nested PublicationDetailsModal (line 165). Inventory missed it."},{"file":"src/features/evidence-investigation/EvidenceInvestigationCluster.jsx → src/components/DD214Analyzer.jsx","was":"nestedChildModals:false","shouldBe":"nestedChildModals:true","why":"DD214Analyzer renders DD214FormBuilder (line 2359), a z-[9999] createPortal modal. Inventory's nestedChildModals:false is wrong."}],"inventoryLooksComplete":false,"notes":"Inventory covered 93 entries and is strong on event-driven modals, but its discovery method (openX window events + *Modal*.jsx names) systematically missed: (1) modals reached only through PARENT-COMPONENT state rather than window events — RegulationsReference (via VAResources), the admin shells FeatureLookup/BugLookup (via AdminPanel); (2) a distinct full-page variant — TermsOfServicePage.jsx vs the inventoried TermsOfServiceModal.jsx (two different files, only one captured); (3) overlays mounted in shell wrappers, not AppModals — VisionSimulator (AppModals does mount it, plain miss), SmallScreenWarning (AppShellOverlays), StressReliefDivision (AppShellTop); (4) several nested child modals under modals it marked nestedChildModals:false (DD214FormBuilder, PublicationDetailsModal, Pathfinder drop-in). Risk classifications, shellPattern descriptions, size recommendations, z-index notes, and the topByRisk ordering for the entries it DID capture are accurate and well-reasoned. VADataCenter's dual-mode/hasRoleDialog:false call is correct. AppModals.jsx and AppShellOverlays.jsx are pure mounting wrappers (no own shell) and correctly excluded. Net: ~10 additional modal surfaces (3 top-level, 2 full-screen admin, 5 nested children) plus 3 nestedChildModals flags to flip. True modal-surface count is closer to ~103."}
